{"rank": 170, "root": "سعي", "form": 1, "lemma": "سَعَى", "count": 20, "ayahCount": 20, "share": 0.1, "meaning": {"bs": "truditi se, žuriti", "en": "to strive, to hasten", "tr": "çabalamak, acele etmek", "fr": "s'efforcer, se hâter", "id": "bersegera, berusaha", "ur": "کوشش کرنا، دوڑنا", "bn": "চেষ্টা করা, দ্রুত চলা", "fa": "شتافتن، کوشیدن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/9f42a132c72d2ec03504.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-saa_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes saa_1-ws{from{transform:rotate(-34deg)}}@keyframes saa_1-wt{from{transform:rotate(34deg)}}.va-saa_1 .ll,.va-saa_1 .ra{transform:rotate(34deg);animation:saa_1-ws 0.3s ease-in-out 9 alternate both}.va-saa_1 .rl,.va-saa_1 .la{transform:rotate(-34deg);animation:saa_1-wt 0.3s ease-in-out 9 alternate both}.va-saa_1 .tr{transform:rotate(8deg)}@keyframes saa_1-m{from{transform:translateX(-64px)}}.va-saa_1 .fig{animation:saa_1-m 2.7s ease-out both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-saa_1.off,.va-saa_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-saa_1,.va-saa_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114M14 56h10M8 50h10\"/><g transform=\"translate(84 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "سَعَىٰ", "plain": "سَعَى", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/9f42a132c72d2ec03504.m4a", "recited": "audio/25bf41